There currently is a small penalty for wishing for artifacts.  Whenever 
you wish for one, your current prayer timeout is increased.  So don't 
wish for an artifact and then pray.

My favorite wish, a figurine of Archon, is the only way I know of to 
indirectly get an artifact without this penalty (since the Archon
often carries a Sunsword or something).
